Report clip/cull distances and multiViewport for DXVK

DXVK refuses a device without them, so D3D11 games stop with
"DX11 feature level 10.0 is required". Mali has no clip/cull distances;
the shader variables are demoted to temporaries and only viewport 0 is
drawn.

